{"seq":3,"slug":"source-of-philosophy","title":"Source Of Philosophy","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/source-of-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"teacher-of-plato","title":"柏拉图之师","url":"/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/source-of-philosophy/teacher-of-plato","wordCount":1926,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-socratic-schools","title":"苏格拉底学派","url":"/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/source-of-philosophy/the-socratic-schools","wordCount":2202,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现苏格拉底作为西方哲学源头的地位。作为柏拉图之师，苏格拉底经由柏拉图、再传弟子亚里士多德这一伟大谱系，奠定了整个西方哲学的根基；他的众多弟子还开创了形形色色的\"小苏格拉底学派\"，从不同侧面传承、发展其思想。本章揭示苏格拉底作为西方哲学众多传统之共同源头的崇高地位。\n"}